{
  "TanStack Router authenticated layout (TypeScript)": {
    "prefix": [
      "routeGuard",
      "rg"
    ],
    "isFileTemplate": true,
    "body": [
      "import { Outlet, createFileRoute, redirect } from '@tanstack/react-router';",
      "",
      "export const Route = createFileRoute('/_${1:authenticated}')({",
      "  beforeLoad: ({ context, location }) => {",
      "    if (!context.${2:auth}.isAuthenticated) {",
      "      throw redirect({",
      "        to: '${3:/login}',",
      "        search: { redirect: location.href },",
      "      });",
      "    }",
      "  },",
      "  component: ${4:AuthenticatedLayout},",
      "});",
      "",
      "function ${4}() {",
      "  return (",
      "    <div>",
      "      $0",
      "      <Outlet />",
      "    </div>",
      "  );",
      "}"
    ],
    "description": "Guard a whole branch of the route tree from a pathless layout, and carry the requested href so the login route can return the visitor. The guard runs before any child loader, and the auth value must exist on the router context. Requires @tanstack/react-router.\n\n用无路径布局守卫整个路由分支，并携带原请求 href 以便登录路由把访问者送回；守卫在任何子路由 loader 之前执行，auth 需存在于 router context 上；需要 @tanstack/react-router。",
    "scope": "typescriptreact"
  },
  "TanStack Router login route returning to a redirect (TypeScript)": {
    "prefix": "routeLoginRedirect",
    "isFileTemplate": true,
    "body": [
      "import { createFileRoute, useNavigate } from '@tanstack/react-router';",
      "import { z } from 'zod';",
      "",
      "export const Route = createFileRoute('${1:/login}')({",
      "  validateSearch: z.object({",
      "    redirect: z.string().optional(),",
      "  }),",
      "  component: ${2:LoginPage},",
      "});",
      "",
      "function ${2}() {",
      "  const { redirect } = Route.useSearch();",
      "  const navigate = useNavigate();",
      "",
      "  const ${3:handleSubmit} = async () => {",
      "    $0",
      "    await navigate({ to: redirect ?? '${4:/}' });",
      "  };",
      "",
      "  return (",
      "    <form",
      "      onSubmit={(event) => {",
      "        event.preventDefault();",
      "        void ${3}();",
      "      }}",
      "    >",
      "      <button type=\"submit\">${5:Sign in}</button>",
      "    </form>",
      "  );",
      "}"
    ],
    "description": "Complete login route that reads the href a guard stored in search and returns the visitor there after signing in. Requires @tanstack/react-router and zod.\n\n完整的登录路由：读取守卫存入 search 的 href，登录后把访问者送回该地址；需要 @tanstack/react-router 与 zod。",
    "scope": "typescriptreact"
  }
}
